  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Once per day a battle butler can define a single character as their master as a swift action. He may do this one additional time per day for every 4 levels of battle butler he attains. This designation lasts for 24 hours or until the battle butler defines a new master. At 1st level the battle butler may only have one master at a time. When adjacent to the battle butler their master gains a deflection bonus to their AC equal to the battle butler’s Dexterity bonus. This deflection bonus to his master’s AC cannot exceed 1/2 his battle butler level (minimum +1). If the battle butler is unconscious, dead, or otherwise incapacitated his master(s) do not benefit from this but the contract remains in effect (he does not have to renew it upon being restored).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/battle-butler#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
